 Alternative keys are shown in parentheses:[20d^G     (F1)[18GDisplay this help text[21d^X     (F2)[18GClose the current buffer / Exit from nano[2d^G     (F1)[18GDisplay this help text[3d^X     (F2)      Close the current buffer / Exit from nano[K[4d^O     (F3)      Write the current buffer (or the marked region) to disk [5d^R     (Ins)     Insert another file into current buffer (or into new buffer)[6d[K[7d^F     (^W)      Search forward for a string or a regular expression [8d^\     (M-R)     Replace a string or a regular expression[K[9d^K     (F9)      Cut current line (or marked region) and store it in cutbuffer[10d^U     (F10)     Paste the contents of cutbuffer at current cursor position[11d[K[12d^T               Execute a function or an external command[K[13d^J     (F4)      Justify the current paragraph[K[14d[K[15d^C     (F11)     Display the position of the cursor[K[16d^/     (M-G)     Go to line and column number[K[17d[K[18dM-U              Undo the last operation   [19dM-E[19;18HRedo the last undone operation[20d[K[21dM-A    (^6[18GMark text starting from the cursor position[2dM-%        [18GPush the cursor line to the center, then top, then bottom[3d[K[4d^S         [18GSave file without prompting[K[5d[K[6dM-Z[6;18HHidden interface enable/disable[7dM-X        [18GHelp mode enable/disable[K[8dM-C              Constant cursor position display enable/disable[9dM-N        [18GLine numbering enable/disable[K[10d[K[11dM-P[11;18HWhitespace display enable/disable[12dM-Y[12;18HColor syntax highlighting enable/disable [13dM-S        [18GSoft wrapping of overlong lines enable/disable[15dM-L              Hard wrapping of overlong lines enable/disable[16dM-O              Conversion of typed tabs to spaces enable/disable[17dM-I[17;18HAuto indent enable/disable[18d[K[19dM-H[19;18HSmart home key enable/disable [20dM-K[20;18HCut to end enable/disable[21;3HM        [19Gouse support enable/disable[K[24d[JM[C[0;7mC[m Cancel[KM[0;7mSearch:                                                                         [22;9H[m[34h[?25h[?25l[22;31H[1K [0;7m[ Search Wrapped ][m[K[23;2H[0;7mL[m Refresh   [0;7m^F[m Where Is  [0;7mM-B[m Previous [0;7m^P[m Prev Line [0;7m^Y[m Prev Page [0;7mM-\[m First Line[24d[0;7m^X[m Close     [0;7m^B[m Where Was [0;7mM-F[m Next     [0;7m^N[m Next Line [0;7m^V[m Next Page [0;7mM-/[m Last Line[2d^X     (F2)[18GClose the current buffer / Exit from nano[K[3d^O     (F3)[18GWrite the current buffer (or the marked region) to disk[4d^R     (Ins)     Insert another file into current buffer (or into new buffer)[6d^F     (^W)[18GSearch forward for a string or a regular expression[7d^\     (M-R)     Replace a string or a regular expression[8d^K     (F9)[19Gut current line (or marked region) and store it in cutbuffer[9d^U     (F10)     Paste the contents of cutbuffer at current cursor position[11d^T [11;18HExecute a function or an external command[12d^J     (F4)[18G[30m[103mJustify[39;49m[m the current paragraph[K[13d[K[14d^C     (F11)     Display the position of the cursor[15d^/     (M-G)     Go to line and column number[K[16d[K[17dM-U[17;18HUndo the last operation   [18dM-E[18;18HRedo the last undone operation[19d[K[20dM-A    (^6)[18GMark text starting from the cursor position[21;3H6    (M-^)     Copy current line (or marked region) and store it in cutbuffer[12;18H[22d[K[24;79H[2d^I[9GTab)     Insert a tab at the cursor position (or indent marked lines)[3d^M[9GEnter)   Insert a newline at the cursor position[K[4d[K[5d^H     (Bsp)     Delete the character to the left of the cursor[6d^D[9GDel)     Delete the character under the cursor[K[7d[K[8dM-Bsp  (Sh-^Del) Delete backward from cursor to word start[K[9d^Del             Delete forward from cursor to next word star